# Google App Engine Viva Questions + Theory + Lab Answers (Python)

# 1. What is Google App Engine?

Google App Engine is a **Platform as a Service (PaaS)** provided by [Google Cloud Platform](https://cloud.google.com?utm_source=chatgpt.com) to build, deploy, and host web applications without managing servers.

---

# 2. What is PaaS?

PaaS (Platform as a Service) provides:

* Runtime environment
* Server management
* Deployment tools
* Scalability

Developer only writes code.

---

# 3. Difference Between IaaS, PaaS, SaaS

| Type | Meaning                     | Example           |
| ---- | --------------------------- | ----------------- |
| IaaS | Infrastructure as a Service | AWS EC2           |
| PaaS | Platform as a Service       | Google App Engine |
| SaaS | Software as a Service       | Gmail             |

---

