# MOST IMPORTANT LAB PROGRAM

## Hello World App

```python
from flask import Flask

app = Flask(__name__)

@app.route('/')
def hello():
    return "Hello World from Google App Engine"

if __name__ == '__main__':
    app.run(host='127.0.0.1', port=8080, debug=True)
```

---

# `app.yaml`

```yaml
runtime: python311
```

