# Multi Page App

```python
from flask import Flask

app = Flask(__name__)

@app.route('/')
def home():
    return "<h1>Home Page</h1>"

@app.route('/about')
def about():
    return "<h1>About Page</h1>"

@app.route('/contact')
def contact():
    return "<h1>Contact Page</h1>"

if __name__ == '__main__':
    app.run(host='127.0.0.1', port=8080, debug=True)
```

